      "text": "```python\nimport math\nfrom functools import lru_cache\n\ndef bell_number(n):\n    @lru_cache(maxsize=None)\n    def bell(n):\n        if n == 0:\n            return 1\n        return sum(math.comb(n - 1, k) * bell(k) for k in range(n))\n    return bell(n)\n```",
